t; width: 3.24pt; border-right: 1pt solid #000000; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 3.24pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3.25pt; width: 42pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000000;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">10<br/></div></div></div><div>
