rif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: center;"><img alt="" src="ny20016494x1_arrowx1.jpg" style="margin-left: 7pt; height: 11px; width: 9px;"/><br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">&#8201;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 300pt; padding-top: 0.36pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Providing effective support and advice to the asset management and acquisitions teams on real estate and government contracting matters.</div></td><td style="width: 6pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 132pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 12pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 4.5pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 300pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 2.75pt; width: 6pt; background-color: #C5C4CF;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 18pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">The decision to pay each of Messrs. Crate and Ibe and Ms.&#160;Marino 100% of their target bonus with respect to their individual subjective component was based on an assessment of each individual&#8217;s contributions to the </div></div></div><div class="BRDSX_block-frill" style="width: 468pt; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_unknown" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 9.47pt; text-align: center;">39<br/></div></div></div><div>
