</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 468pt;"><a id="ny20039690x1_def14a_108-pvp_pg2"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 468pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_9" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_8"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_cont_4" id="_AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_cont_3"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_EqtyAwrdsAdjFnTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="ecd:EqtyAwrdsAdjFnTextBlock" id="ixv-12908"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 6.75pt; margin-left: 18pt;"><tr><td style="width: 24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">(b)<br/></div></td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><div style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; text-align: left;">The equity award adjustments for each fiscal year include the following: (i)&#160;the addition of the year-end fair value of any equity awards granted in the year that are outstanding and unvested as of the end of the year; (ii)&#160;for any awards granted in prior years that are outstanding and unvested as of the end of the fiscal year, the addition (or subtraction, if applicable) of the change in fair value of between the end of the prior fiscal year the end of the applicable fiscal year; (iii)&#160;for awards that are granted and vest in the same fiscal year, the addition of the fair value of such awards as of the vesting date; (iv)&#160;for awards granted in prior years that vest during the fiscal year, the addition (or subtraction, if applicable) of the change in fair value between the end of the prior fiscal year and the vesting date of such awards; (v)&#160;for awards granted in prior years that fail to meet the applicable vesting conditions during the fiscal year, the subtraction of the fair value of such awards at the end of the prior fiscal year; and (vi)&#160;the dollar value of any dividends or other earnings paid on such awards in the applicable year prior to the vesting date. The amounts deducted or added in calculating the equity award adjustments are as follows: </div></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><ix:continuation continuedAt="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_10" id="_PvpTableTextBlock-c0_cont_9"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_cont_5" id="_AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock-c0_cont_4"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_EqtyAwrdsAdjFnTextBlock-c0_cont_2" id="_EqtyAwrdsAdjFnTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; width: 428pt; margin-left: 40pt;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 4pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 60pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3.56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3.56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 45.09pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3.56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3.56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 45.49pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3.56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3